OL,3,GNEWSANew croquet club revitalises
OL,4,Aformer bowling green
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former bowls lawn has been given a
OL,7,Fnew lease of life and become the home
OL,8,Fof a newly-launched croquet club.
OL,10,FStroud Croquet Club has opened at
OL,11,FStratford Park Leisure Centre, in
OL,12,FGloucestershire, on the lawn previously
OL,13,Fused by Stroud Bowls Club.
OL,15,FThe bowls club had been based there for
OL,16,Fmore than 80 years before closing last
OL,17,Fsummer amid falling membership and
OL,18,Ffinancial pressures.
OL,20,FNow the green has been transformed for
OL,21,Fcroquet with the new club already being
OL,22,Fembraced by people of all ages.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
